[{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0053","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0053.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-9617","title":"Netsweeper Netsweeper 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Netsweeper 4.0.5 之前版本中的 remotereporter/load_logfiles.php 存在开放重定向漏洞（CWE-601），远程攻击者可通过向 url 参数传入恶意 URL，诱使用户点击特制链接后跳转到任意外部站点，进而实施钓鱼攻击。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，但需要用户交互，影响 Netsweeper 内容过滤系统的正常使用。厂商已在 4.0.5 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2014-9617"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-02-19T21:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:18:39Z","remediation":"升级 Netsweeper 至 4.0.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 remotereporter/load_logfiles.php 中 url 参数未经验证的重定向问题。如无法立即升级，可在 WAF 层面添加规则拦截包含恶意 url 参数的请求，或限制对该脚本的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/133034/Netsweeper-Bypass-XSS-Redirection-SQL-Injection-Execution.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9617.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-9617.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9617.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-9617/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-9617.py","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/7001-to-8000-templates/cve-2014-9617-2450.yaml","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs_dev/nucleibak/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9617.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2014-9617_45.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/ad32beb8a6ecc99ff5b9401392fe4eb738c13e96/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-96xx/CVE-2014-9617.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2014-9617.js","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2014-9617-2449.yaml","https://github.com/1979139113/0day-today-exploits/blob/8b2194688e3c722fe9369b045e37382e7f45e12b/24031.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0053.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0052","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0052.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-9615","title":"Netsweeper Netsweeper 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Netsweeper 4.0.4 的 Web 管理后台 `webadmin/deny/index.php` 中存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向 `url` 参数注入任意 HTML 或 JavaScript 脚本，当管理员或用户访问特制链接时，恶意脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或钓鱼攻击。该漏洞源于程序在 Web 页面生成时未对用户输入进行正确的转义处理，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2014-9615"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-02-19T20:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:18:39Z","remediation":"升级 Netsweeper 至 4.0.4 之后的安全修复版本（如 6.x 系列），或联系厂商获取最新补丁。若无法升级，在 Web 服务器或反向代理层添加 WAF 规则，对 `webadmin/deny/index.php` 的 `url` 参数进行输入过滤，拦截 `<script>`、`onerror=` 等 XSS 载荷；同时在应用层对输出进行 HTML 实体编码，确保用户输入不被浏览器解释为可执行脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/133034/Netsweeper-Bypass-XSS-Redirection-SQL-Injection-Execution.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9615.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-9615.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9615.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-9615/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-9615.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2014-9615.yaml","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs/nuclei/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9615.yaml","https://github.com/cyb3r-w0lf/nuclei-template-collection/blob/7025ebe04ab60b84aee0af1ecf4f90601332e8e7/nuclei-templates/CVE-2014/cve-2014-9615.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2014/9xxx/CVE-2014-9615.json","https://github.com/Angelina612/CVSS-Severity-Predictor/blob/d5742adecae52600c769d5b27990aa6ea9b2fdba/trainCVSSV3/NVD_2014_CVSSV3_train.csv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2014-9615.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2014-9615-2444.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0052.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0051","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0051.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-9614","title":"Netsweeper Web Panel 硬编码凭证漏洞","description":"Netsweeper Web Panel 4.0.5 之前版本存在硬编码凭证漏洞，其 branding 账户使用固定的默认密码 \"branding\"。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过向 /webadmin/ 路径发送请求，利用该硬编码凭证直接登录管理后台，获取系统完全控制权限，包括敏感数据访问、配置篡改及进一步内网渗透。该漏洞影响所有低于 4.0.5 的 Netsweeper 版本，攻击复杂度低，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-9614"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-02-19T20:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:18:38Z","remediation":"立即升级 Netsweeper 至 4.0.5 或更高版本，该版本已移除硬编码默认凭据。如无法立即升级，登录 Web Panel 后手动修改 branding 账户的默认密码为强密码（至少 12 位含大小写字母、数字和特殊字符），并在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）层面限制 /webadmin/ 路径仅允许可信管理 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/133034/Netsweeper-Bypass-XSS-Redirection-SQL-Injection-Execution.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9614.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-9614.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/bl