T20:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:18:38Z","remediation":"升级 Netsweeper 至 3.1.10（3.x 分支）、4.0.9（4.0.x 分支）或 4.1.2（4.1.x 分支）及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）层面配置访问控制规则，限制对 `/webadmin/reporter/` 路径的访问，仅允许受信管理 IP 段访问该目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/133034/Netsweeper-Bypass-XSS-Redirection-SQL-Injection-Execution.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9609.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-9609.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9609.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-9609/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-9609.py","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2014-9609-2438.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Netsweeper/CVE-2014-9609.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2014/9xxx/CVE-2014-9609.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2014-9609_30.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2014-9609-2437.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2014-9609-2437.yaml","https://github.com/arkede/cve-2014/blob/ef6026b737c984b3e00fb2efc8e187240c55ec3d/cve-2014-9609-2439.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0050.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0049","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0049.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-9608","title":"Netsweeper Netsweeper 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Netsweeper 的 webadmin/policy/group_table_ajax.php 页面存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，由于对用户输入的 PATH_INFO 参数未进行充分的转义处理，远程攻击者可构造恶意 URL 诱使用户点击，从而在目标浏览器中执行任意 HTML 或 JavaScript 脚本。该漏洞影响 Netsweeper 3.1.10 之前版本、4.0.x 系列 4.0.9 之前版本及 4.1.x 系列 4.1.2 之前版本，攻击无需身份认证但需用户交互，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2014-9608"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-02-19T20:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:18:38Z","remediation":"升级 Netsweeper 至安全版本：3.x 系列升级到 3.1.10 及以上，4.0.x 系列升级到 4.0.9 及以上，4.1.x 系列升级到 4.1.2 及以上。如无法立即升级，可在 WAF 或反向代理层对 `webadmin/policy/group_table_ajax.php/` 路径的 `PATH_INFO` 参数进行 HTML 编码过滤，阻止未转义的特殊字符注入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/133034/Netsweeper-Bypass-XSS-Redirection-SQL-Injection-Execution.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9608.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-9608.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9608.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-9608/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-9608.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2014-9608.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2014-9608_2.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2014-9608_2_3.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/7001-to-8000-templates/cve-2014-9608-2434.yaml","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2014/9xxx/CVE-2014-9608.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2014/CVE-2014-9608.rules","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2014-9608-2434.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0049.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0048","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-9607","title":"Netsweeper Netsweeper 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Netsweeper 4.0.3 及 4.0.4 版本的 remotereporter/load_logfiles.php 文件中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 url 参数注入恶意的 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，当管理员或其他用户访问被攻击的链接时，注入的脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或钓鱼攻击。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，但需要用户交互触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2014-9607"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-02-19T20:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:18:38Z","remediation":"升级 Netsweeper 至 4.0.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 remotereporter/load_logfiles.php 中 url 参数未正确转义的问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）配置中对 /remotereporter/ 路径添加访问控制，仅允许受信 IP 访问，或通过 WAF 规则拦截包含可疑 script/onerror 等 XSS 载荷的 url 参数请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/133034/Netsweeper-Bypass-XSS-Redirection-SQL-Injection-Execution.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9607.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-9607.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9607.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-9607/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-9607.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2014-9607.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Netsweeper/CVE-2014-9607.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2014/9xxx/CVE-2014-9607.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2014-9607-2433.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2014-9607_2.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8d66134d58507274c19d4d07fee64de1baa247fa/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-96xx/CVE-2014-9607.json","https://github.com/arkede/cve-2014/blob/ef6026b737c984b3e00fb2efc8e187240c55ec3d/cve-2014-9607-2433.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0048.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0047","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0047.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-9606","title":"Netsweeper Netsweeper 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Netsweeper 内容过滤系统存在多个跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，版本 3.1.10 之前、4.0.x 至 4.0.9 之前以及 4.1.x 至 4.1.2 之前的版本均受影响。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造特制的参数，分别向 remotereporter/load_logfiles.php 的 server 参数、webadmin/policy/category_table_ajax.php 的 customctid 参数、webadmin/alert/alert.php 的 urllist 参数、webadmin/ajaxfilemanager/ajax_get_file_listing.php 的 QUERY_STRING 以及 webadmin/policy/policy_table_ajax.php/ 的 PATH_INFO 注入任意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码。当管理员或用户访问被注入恶意脚本的页面时，攻击者可窃取会话 Cookie、劫持管理会话或执行其他恶意操作。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危，攻击复杂度低，但需要用户交互（点击链接）才能触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2014-9606"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-02-19T20:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:18:38Z","remediation":"升级 Netsweeper 至 3.1.10、4.0.9 或 4.1.2 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，在 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 层面添加规则，对 `server`、`customctid`、`urllist`、`QUERY_STRING`、`PATH_INFO` 等参数进行输入过滤和输出编码，并启用 Content-Security-Policy 头作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/133034/Netsweeper-Bypass-XSS-Redirection-SQL-Injection-Execution.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9606.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-9606.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9606.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-9606/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-9606.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2014-9606_3.yaml","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs/nuclei/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9606.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2014/9xxx/CVE-2014-9606.json","https://github.com/gongzeq/VAPT3/blob/3576a7accf5cbadc8e64924d6ff48393db379ea7/secbot/resource/poc/cve/cve-2014-9606-2430.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2014/9xxx/CVE-2014-9606.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/README.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2014-9606.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0047.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0040","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-8739","title":"Creative Solutions Creative Contact Form 任意文件上传漏洞","description":"Creative Solutions 开发的 Creative Contact Form（前身为 Sexy Contact Form）WordPress 插件 1.0.0 之前版本及 Joomla! 组件 2.0.1 之前版本中集成的 jQuery File Upload Plugin 6.4.4 存在危险类型文件无限制上传漏洞。该漏洞源于 server/php/UploadHandler.php 未对上传文件的扩展名进行有效过滤，允许远程未认证攻击者直接上传包含 .php 扩展名的恶意文件，随后通过直接访问 files/ 目录下的该文件即可实现任意代码执行。该漏洞已在 2014 年 10 月被野外利用，影响范围广泛，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-8739"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-02-08T18:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:17:15Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 版 Creative Contact Form 升级至 1.0.0 及以上版本，Joomla! 版升级至 2.0.1 及以上版本。同时限制上传目录的 PHP 执行权限，在 web 服务器配置中禁止 files/ 目录解析 PHP 文件，并移除服务器端未使用的文件上传处理脚本 UploadHandler.php。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/show/osvdb/113669","http://osvdb.org/show/osvdb/113673","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2014/11/11/4","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2014/11/11/5","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2014/11/13/3","https://wordpress.org/plugins/sexy-contact-form/changelog/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35057/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36811/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35057","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-8739.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-8739.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-8739.yaml","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/6f55cdabfee7f424985cda0793a68247672d750d/2014/CVE-2014-8739.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-8739","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2014/CVE-2014-8739.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2014-8739_5.yaml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/packagist/blueimp/jquery-file-upload/CVE-2014-8739.yml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2014-8739_3.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/GHSA/data/2014/CVE-2014-8739.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2014/7xxx/CVE-2014-7969.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2014/POC-AVE-2014-0040.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2014/EXP-AVE-2014-0040.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0026","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-4561","title":"WordPress Ultimate Weather 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 ultimate-weather 插件 1.0 版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，该插件在生成天气信息页面时未对用户输入进行正确的转义处理。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标站点发送特制的 URL，诱使用户点击后，在受害浏览器中执行任意 HTML 或 JavaScript 脚本，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击无需认证但需要用户交互，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2014-4561"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-01-10T14:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:10:14Z","remediation":"立即停用并删除 WordPress 插件 ultimate-weather 1.0 版本（开发者已停止维护，无安全更新）。如业务必须使用，可选用以下缓解措施：1) 在 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 中配置规则拦截包含 `<script>`、`onerror=` 等 XSS 载荷的 URL 参数；2) 在 WordPress 主题的 functions.php 中添加 `add_filter('the_title', 'esc_html');` 对输出内容转义编码；3) 安装安全插件（如 Wordfence）启用 XSS 防护规则。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://codevigilant.com/disclosure/wp-plugin-ultimate-weather-plugin-a3-cross-site-scripting-xss/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-4561.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-4561.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/edc652d6e05ef25aee5fb9d5d13e49f90fcfe6b7/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-4561.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-4561/poc/pocsploit/CVE